  "fishing_pool": "dusty-river",
  "description": "The northern plains open into a broad yellow-green valley, with red mesas standing on the distant horizon. A blue pool sits on the right between rounded boulders and trees. The pale dirt track curves past it through low scrub and stretches towards the central distance. Wooden fence sections cross the grass, and a small windmill is visible farther to the right. Flowers and hardy plants cluster near the foreground rocks. The painted water and scattered trees soften the otherwise dry ground, while the large open sky and long view keep this part of the frontier feeling exposed.",
